onal function that performs three-dimensional image processing.\n\nIt is to be installed and used on general-purpose IT equipment, etc. that meets the specifications specified by Holoeyes Corporation (hereinafter referred to as \"the Company\") in the manner specified by the Company and provided as a download. For details, please refer to the attached document.\n\nThe latest version of the attached document (electronic attachment) https://holoeyes.jp/pmda/", "short_description": "The medical imaging software \"Holoeyes MD\" is a controlled medical device (generic name: program for general-purpose diagnostic imaging workstations, certification number: 302ADBZX00011000) under the \"Act on Quality, Efficacy and Safety Assurance of Pharmaceuticals, Medical Devices, etc.\" (Pharmaceuticals and Medical Devices Act)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "md_logo.png", "id": "5998065973633964", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003260_5998065976967297_260827317627691552_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DH3c9XGg5DAQ7kNvwGyOlwS&_nc_oc=AdqQu0ZJ0JQJLHQRwMEteCMd51TWfqTfq8_vhnWYUEm9HbJi7bORLth09ePoonA6ZVU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af389qPql8WVenXQ2rnfGEvPgAX_lokNbVLG5RV8xKkoUg&oe=69E0D54D"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_tate.png", "id": "2303415159832893", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974904_2303415163166226_7688600240374808365_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IKJwZ-qVqIcQ7kNvwEUTHSn&_nc_oc=AdqvUjxUxyMB_dHTtC_gJhJX77Ws1GUlzACszphaOXteNbqcseTbgiUIbF5eWTe1eig&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af28vnbO7MkDOOGRfYWjlxhVvz1R2ZE4A7pxi1DLk7w78g&oe=69E0C7AC"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_miniyoko.png", "id": "950325029433473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031585_950325032766806_6345